WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.111
(crowd cheering)
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.111 --> 00:00:07.028
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:18.506 --> 00:00:20.676
(upbeat orchestral music)

00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:22.842
- [Narrator] In the Besòs
neighborhood of Barcelona,

00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:25.011
there is a unique group of girls.

00:00:25.011 --> 00:00:26.338
(girls chattering)

00:00:26.338 --> 00:00:27.792
The country's first, and only,

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:30.146
all-female cricket team.

00:00:30.146 --> 00:00:32.968
And this team is made up
entirely of immigrants.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:36.885
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:42.964 --> 00:00:44.056
(crowd cheering)

00:00:44.056 --> 00:00:48.776
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:48.776 --> 00:00:49.882
(tapping)

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.743
(upbeat guitar music)

00:00:51.743 --> 00:00:55.894
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:55.894 --> 00:00:56.727
(crowd cheering)

00:00:56.727 --> 00:01:00.644
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:05.647
(crowd cheering)
(crowd applauding)

00:01:05.647 --> 00:01:09.564
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:24.449 --> 00:01:25.532
(dramatic music)

00:01:25.532 --> 00:01:26.365
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:26.365 --> 00:01:28.012
The team has allowed the
girls to form a community

00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:29.723
of their own, while at the same time,

00:01:29.723 --> 00:01:31.646
helping to overcome the challenges

00:01:31.646 --> 00:01:33.688
of immigrating to a new country.

00:01:33.688 --> 00:01:37.605
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:50.928 --> 00:01:51.851
(crowd cheering)

00:01:51.851 --> 00:01:55.768
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:01.378
(crowd cheering)

